  "resolutionNotes": [
    "Retained early plugin version discovery, dependency/source lookup, trait/type/format/JSON macro and helper-state diagnostics; corrected concrete error types and the published Option-returning Shell adapter.",
    "Extended the existing MiniButton with disabled support and scoped the Shelf footer font to the exact source size/weight. Initial visual captures remain superseded; final prefix is v52-shelf-e2.",
    "Shelf drops now persist directly rather than leaving the old v2.5 placeholder draft; actual native IPC proves the consumed draft and original-file preservation.",
    "Direct crates.io metadata request returned403; the accepted dependency audit uses the existing Cargo sparse index record and verifies the cached published archive SHA256. No credentials or access policy changed.",
    "Original source/evidence from V5.1 is unchanged; all v52 failed/superseded logs and captures remain. Only the named final reports share the accepted manifest/executable."
